{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"9cb34d05-c743-48f3-8f1c-40af1801cf1a","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The incident on 2026-09-23 in `eu-west` was caused by a zero-delay retry storm introduced with API release `2026.09.23.1` under feature flag `tenant_retry_policy`, where failing jobs for tenants without explicit policies evaluated to an empty policy (`policy=\"\"`) and executed immediate retries (`delay_ms=0`), exhausting database connection pools and causing worker CPU utilization to drop to 18% due to connection starvation. The operational decision to scale workers from 40 to 90 exacerbated the failure by maxing out the database connection limit of 300 and spilling connection starvation over to the API checkout service. Disabling the feature flag at 09:43 UTC restored the default exponential backoff (`delay_ms=1000`), allowing jobs to complete and the queue backlog to fully clear by 10:18 UTC.\n\n**Deliverables Status**: I have completed every deliverable specified in [TASK.md](file:///tmp/claude-1000/-home-arda-projects-agent-evaluation/8413ce30-b544-4ae4-afd6-5f8333042ec1/scratchpad/agent-eval-gemini-3.1-pro/09-incident-analysis/TASK.md):\n- [INCIDENT.md](file:///tmp/claude-1000/-home-arda-projects-agent-evaluation/8413ce30-b544-4ae4-afd6-5f8333042ec1/scratchpad/agent-eval-gemini-3.1-pro/09-incident-analysis/INCIDENT.md)\n- [ACTIONS.md](file:///tmp/claude-1000/-home-arda-projects-agent-evaluation/8413ce30-b544-4ae4-afd6-5f8333042ec1/scratchpad/agent-eval-gemini-3.1-pro/09-incident-analysis/ACTIONS.md)\n- [CUSTOMER_UPDATE.md](file:///tmp/claude-1000/-home-arda-projects-agent-evaluation/8413ce30-b544-4ae4-afd6-5f8333042ec1/scratchpad/agent-eval-gemini-3.1-pro/09-incident-analysis/CUSTOMER_UPDATE.md)\n- [RESPONSE.md](file:///tmp/claude-1000/-home-arda-projects-agent-evaluation/8413ce30-b544-4ae4-afd6-5f8333042ec1/scratchpad/agent-eval-gemini-3.1-pro/09-incident-analysis/RESPONSE.md)\n\n**Model ID**: Gemini 3.1 Pro (High)\n","duration_seconds":181.7197